# Hall supplier and consumer review — 2026-10-23

Run: `advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23`. Round 1, independent owner-context scientific review. Verdict: **the inspected finite-quiver proof chain is sound at its full stated scope and supplies the planned abstract mathematical interface. Recommend resolving this Step-1 planning escalation on this evidence.** No source theorem correction or substitute lemma is needed. This review creates no publication, imported-proof audit, native gate, or physical-realization acceptance. Root owns the resolution row, current-input bindings and recertification.

