## Reading and identity

Read both CLAUDE files and the physics README fully, the owner-authoring direction and native drift report fully, the applicable SCHEMA publication/domain/physical-interface rules and WORKFLOW construction/escalation rules. Read the complete Statement, Facts and Proof of the three named suppliers, the representation/Euler lemma, phase lemma, extension-orbit lemma, generic Hall finiteness and associativity results, and quotient-flag lemma; read the two quiver definitions and generic Hall definition completely. Read the local Hall generator definition, spectrum-invariance proposition and CY3 bridge-contract definition completely. The attached JSON records the exact file hashes and reading limits.

