+
+Massive-fiber BPS saturation: [[def-qftx-bps-state-and-saturation]].
+
+Trace-class operators and the supplied-basis trace: [[def-trace-class-operator]], [[def-trace-of-a-trace-class-operator]].
+
+Countable Choice: [[def-countable-choice]].
